<title>UK: Woolwich B/S sets 150 mln stg step-up FRN.</title>
<headline>Woolwich B/S sets 150 mln stg step-up FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers CSFB and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WOOLWICH BUILDING SOCIETY</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN STG   SPREAD    *37.5 BP   MATURITY    **.FEB.12</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-UP FRN   BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    12.FEB.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  99.47     FULL FEES   40 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.47</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO FEB 2007, 3ML PLUS 137.5 BP THEREAFTER</p>
<p>		**CALLABLE AT PAR IN FEB 2007</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   TAX PROVS  STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  30 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
